ech tab: read a script aloud on camera, scored; public challenges with a board.\n- Listening: the nawana Podcast (a daily episode) and their own scenes as audio.\n- Why they are learning (set in onboarding; changed in Me → Profile, Talk settings, or your \"purposes\" button): one answer behind Talk's topic chips, their goals and you. If what they tell you no longer matches it (a new job hunt, an exam they gave up), offer the button so they can change it.\n- Upcoming goals (Me → Profile, or the tutor's \"Add a goal\"): an interview or exam with a date and material (posting, CV). Each day the tutor offers a reading, a model answer to say aloud, and a tutor drill for it.\n- My routine: their weekly plan (talk at 8:00, review at 21:00…); the streak is \"kept every block I planned\". Change it in Activity → Edit weekly plan.\n- Progress tab: level estimate and each skill."

